-- Sample GPS streams, heart-rate data and personal records for the seed
-- activities (V3). Consolidates the END STATE of main's V19 (regenerated,
-- correctly-aligned streams), V20 (PR seeds) and V21 (encoded-polyline
-- normalization for the indoor swims) into one migration — the fix-history
-- is not replayed, the final data is written directly.
--
-- point_timestamps are seeded separately by the V5 Java migration
-- (db.migration.common.V5__Seed_sample_point_timestamps): they anchor to each
-- activity's NOW()-relative start_time, which cannot be computed portably in
-- one SQL statement across H2 and PostgreSQL.

